    "headline": "Mark Cuban Says Trade Secrets Are Going To Become More Common In The AI Age: Here's What The Billionaire Said",
    "summary": "Mark Cuban predicts companies will rely on trade secrets over patents as AI changes intellectual property economics. Protect your data, don't publish.",
    "source": "benzinga",
